    "title_en": "Recent Developments in perturbative calculations on DVCS",
    "abstract_en": "We provide a brief review of the recent progress on the perturbative calculations of the Deeply-Virtual Compton Scattering (DVCS) process, both in the higher-order (${ O}(\\alpha_s)$) and higher-power correction (${O}(1/Q)$) frontiers. This series of studies is indispensable for analyzing high-precision data from current JLAB-12 and future EIC, EIcC experiments.",
